<name>Cherry blossom paths (Busan)</name>
<description><![CDATA[Four cherry-blossom walks in Busan, all reachable by metro. Busan blooms about a week before Seoul: usually the last week of March to the first week of April. Oncheoncheon stream, Namcheon-dong to Gwangalli, Dalmaji-gil over the pass to Songjeong, and the Nakdong embankment at Samnak.]]></description>
