<Placemark><name>1. Start – Oncheonjang Station</name><description><![CDATA[Line 1. Walk down to the Oncheoncheon stream and follow it south (downstream). Cherry trees line both banks; the path is flat and lit at night.<br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/entry/place/13479622?lng=129.0863990&lat=35.2202840&placePath=%2Fhome&entry=plt&searchType=place&c=15.00,0,0,0,dh">Open Naver Map</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#icon-1574-0F9D58</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>129.086399,35.220284,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>2. Dongnae Station</name><description><![CDATA[Lines 1 and 4 cross the stream here. The densest blossom stretch is between Oncheonjang and Sebyeong Bridge.<br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/entry/place/13487884?lng=129.0784710&lat=35.2055970&placePath=%2Fhome&entry=plt&searchType=place&c=15.00,0,0,0,dh">Open Naver Map</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#icon-1582-E91E63</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>129.078471,35.205597,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Sebyeong Bridge</name><description><![CDATA[Oncheoncheon Citizens Park: lawns, benches and the festival stage in blossom season.<br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/entry/place/16939061?lng=129.0825830&lat=35.1968630&placePath=%2Fhome&entry=plt&searchType=place&c=15.00,0,0,0,dh">Open Naver Map</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#icon-1582-E91E63</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>129.082583,35.196863,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. End – Oncheoncheon Citizens Park</name><description><![CDATA[The stream bends east here into the park: lawns, the festival stage and food stalls in blossom season. Yeonsan Station (lines 1 and 3) is 15 min south-west; Dongnae Station is 20 min back upstream.<br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/entry/place/16958542?lng=129.0951120&lat=35.1925760&placePath=%2Fhome&entry=plt&searchType=place&c=15.00,0,0,0,dh">Open Naver Map</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#icon-1661-DB4437</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>129.095112,35.192576,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>Namcheon-dong cherry street → Gwangalli (3.4 km)</name>
<Placemark><name>Geumnyeonsan Stn → Namcheon-dong cherry street (Samik Beach) → Gwangalli Beach, 3.4 km</name><description><![CDATA[3.5 km<br>1. Pedestrian router via the cherry street and the beach road (approx.)]]></description><styleUrl>#line-1</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>129.111122,35.150098,0 129.111182,35.150331,0 129.111258,35.150284,0 129.111908,35.149890,0 129.112100,35.149770,0 129.112452,35.149551,0 129.112971,35.149227,0 129.113292,35.149027,0 129.113387,35.148968,0 129.113507,35.148894,0 129.113590,35.148842,0 129.113955,35.148614,0 129.113998,35.148588,0 129.114407,35.148333,0 129.114620,35.148200,0 129.114469,35.147747,0 129.114363,35.147405,0 129.114326,35.147243,0 129.114339,35.147037,0 129.114375,35.146934,0 129.114553,35.146471,0 129.114725,35.145997,0 129.114778,35.145836,0 129.115067,35.144956,0 129.115085,35.144487,0 129.115074,35.143255,0 129.115074,35.143255,0 129.115072,35.143077,0 129.116418,35.143047,0 129.116418,35.143047,0 129.115072,35.143077,0 129.115085,35.144487,0 129.115067,35.144956,0 129.114778,35.145836,0 129.114725,35.145997,0 129.114553,35.146471,0 129.114375,35.146934,0 129.114339,35.147037,0 129.114326,35.147243,0 129.114363,35.147405,0 129.114469,35.147747,0 129.114620,35.148200,0 129.114696,35.148462,0 129.114898,35.149053,0 129.115619,35.149983,0 129.116347,35.150934,0 129.117106,35.151878,0 129.117850,35.152837,0 129.118363,35.153505,0 129.118427,35.153546,0 129.119541,35.154277,0 129.119701,35.154362,0 129.120076,35.154561,0 129.120488,35.154728,0 129.120583,35.154766,0 129.121894,35.155243,0 129.122897,35.155590,0 129.122990,35.155613,0 129.123009,35.155561,0 129.123409,35.155637,0 129.123459,35.155622,0 129.123493,35.155589,0 129.123523,35.155553,0 129.123569,35.155412,0 129.123528,35.155403,0 129.123471,35.155387,0 129.123411,35.155360,0 129.123354,35.155331,0 129.123298,35.155293,0 129.123256,35.155265,0 129.123232,35.155237,0 129.123200,35.155271,0 129.123108,35.155331,0 129.123058,3