<Placemark><name>1. Start – Geumnyeonsan Station exit 3</name><description><![CDATA[Line 2. Walk 5 min south towards the sea; the cherry street begins at the Samik Beach apartment blocks.<br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/entry/place/21404341?lng=129.1111910&lat=35.1500860&placePath=%2Fhome&entry=plt&searchType=place&c=15.00,0,0,0,dh">Open Naver Map</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#icon-1574-0F9D58</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>129.111191,35.150086,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>2. Namcheon-dong cherry street</name><description><![CDATA[About 1 km of 40-year-old cherry trees forming a tunnel between the apartment blocks. Very crowded on peak weekends; weekday mornings are calm.<br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/entry/place/17072178?lng=129.1150620&lat=35.1432550&placePath=%2Fhome&entry=plt&searchType=place&c=15.00,0,0,0,dh">Open Naver Map</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#icon-1582-E91E63</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>129.115062,35.143255,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Samik Beach Town</name><description><![CDATA[The sea-side end of the cherry street. Turn left along Gwangan Beach Road towards the bridge.<br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/entry/place/17075751?lng=129.1164130&lat=35.1430390&placePath=%2Fhome&entry=plt&searchType=place&c=15.00,0,0,0,dh">Open Naver Map</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#icon-1582-E91E63</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>129.116413,35.143039,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. End – Gwangalli Beach</name><description><![CDATA[Cafés and the Gwangan Bridge light show after dark. Gwangan Station (line 2) is 10 min inland.<br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/entry/place/11491655?lng=129.1201410&lat=35.1541210&placePath=%2Fhome&entry=plt&searchType=place&c=15.00,0,0,0,dh">Open Naver Map</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#icon-1661-DB4437</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>129.120141,35.154121,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
